== webview2-gtk API - Package Overview ==

GTK 4 widget embedding Microsoft Edge WebView2 on Windows, plus
''Win32Atspi'' (AT-SPI-shaped accessibility over UI Automation).

Public namespaces:

 * ''[[https://roojs.github.io/webview2-gtk/webview2gtk/WebView2Gtk.html|WebView2Gtk]]'' — ''[[https://roojs.github.io/webview2-gtk/webview2gtk/WebView2Gtk.WebView.html|WebView]]'' and related types (WebKitGTK-shaped API)
 * ''[[https://roojs.github.io/webview2-gtk/webview2gtk/Win32Atspi.html|Win32Atspi]]'' — accessibility tree / actions / keyboard synth

Hand-written notes: [[https://github.com/roojs/webview2-gtk/blob/master/docs/a11y.md|docs/a11y.md]].

